{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04489","headline":"合州津口别舍弟至东阳峡步趂不及眷然有忆作以示之 · 陈子昂","name":"合州津口别舍弟至东阳峡步趂不及眷然有忆作以示之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江潭共爲客，洲浦独迷津。\n思积芳庭树，心断白眉人。\n同衾成楚越，别岛类胡秦。\n林岸随天转，云峰逐望新。\n遥遥终不见，默默坐含嚬。\n念别疑三月，经游未一旬。\n孤舟多逸兴，谁共尔爲邻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04489.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04489","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}